# Nightly CI fix: the recorded sha256 values of these archived files were taken on a Windows checkout (core.autocrlf), i.e. of CRLF bytes,
# while git stores LF; a Linux checkout therefore hashed other bytes. Every OS now checks out the CRLF bytes that were hashed.
# Scope: the files of the 4sw5so archive root (not its figures/ folder, whose hashes are not recorded) and the two WP-E10 re-run
# run_manifest.json files (their manifest_sha256 is recorded in the WP-E4a exact manifest). The index bytes (LF) do not change.
